# Interest / contact form endpoint (Task 1).
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io (one form is enough).
# 2. Copy its endpoint URL (looks like https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz).
# 3. Put it below for local dev, AND add the same variable in
#    Vercel -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables, then redeploy.
# The form degrades to an on-screen error until this is set; no secret is stored in code.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT="https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id"
